# JIT profile mirror for app processes (Android 11 app data isolation reads
# /data_mirror/cur_profiles). phh v313's apex-setup.rc creates this bind mount in an earlier
# trigger, then its "on post-fs-data" mounts a fresh tmpfs over /data_mirror and only redoes the
# data_ce/data_de mirrors -- so apps never recorded usage profiles (MEASURED 2026-10-04: Kindle,
# KOReader, Unlauncher primary.prof all 0 bytes; with the mount, Kindle's grew to 58,820 bytes in
# two minutes). Same lines as AOSP 11 init.rc. Named zz- so init parses it after apex-setup.rc and
# this post-fs-data action runs after that tmpfs mount. Reported by a tester.
on post-fs-data
    mkdir /data_mirror/cur_profiles 0700 root root
    mount none /data/misc/profiles/cur /data_mirror/cur_profiles bind rec
